OL,3,GNEWSAChippy worker scales Yr Wyddfa
OL,4,Athree times barefoot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chip shop worker from Worcestershire
OL,7,Fhas climbed Wales' highest peak
OL,8,Fthree-and-a-half times in 24 hours,
OL,9,Fwhile barefoot.
OL,11,FJosh Mantle, from Stourport, completed
OL,12,Fthe challenge on Yr Wyddfa (Snowdon) on
OL,13,FSaturday evening, despite battling
OL,14,F80mph winds, hail and rain.
OL,16,FThe 20-year-old, who is also recovering
OL,17,Ffrom an ACL injury and has undergone
OL,18,Ftwo surgeries, raised almost #3,000 for
OL,19,FKEMP Hospice in the Wyre Forest.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
