OL,3,GNEWSAChippy worker scales Yr Wyddfa
OL,4,Athree times barefoot
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the conditions were "way worse"
OL,7,Fthan he had prepared for, but that he
OL,8,Ffelt "really proud" after completing
OL,9,Fthe challenge.
